"<p>तपाईँ आकाशमा वस्तु तिनीहरूको नामद्वारा तोक्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t\tCtrl+F, \"फोकस->वस्तु फेला पार्ने\" मेनु वस्तु, वा \"फेला पार्ने\"\n"
"\t\t\tउपकरणपट्टी बटन प्रयोग गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:12
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>To change your Geographic Location,\n"
"\t\t\tuse Ctrl+G, the \"Settings->Set Geographic Location...\" menu item,\n"
"\t\t\tor the \"globe\" Toolbar button.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँको भौगोलिक स्थान परिवर्तन गर्न,\n"
"\t\t\tCtrl+G, \"सेटिङ->भौगोलिक स्थान सेट गर्नुहोस्...\" मेनु वस्तु,\n"
"\t\t\tवा \"ग्लोब\" उपकरणपट्टी बटन प्रयोग गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:21
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>You can Track an object, so it will always be centered\n"
"\t\t\tin the display."
"<br/>\n"
"\t\t\tUse Ctrl+T, the \"Focus->Track Object\" menu item, or the \"lock\"\n"
"\t\t\tToolbar button. You can also simply center the object by\n"
"\t\t\tdouble-clicking on it or selecting \"Center and Track\" from the\n"
"\t\t\tobject's popup menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँ एउटा वस्तु ट्रयाक गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ, जसले गर्दा यो सधै प्रदर्शनमा \n"
"\t\t\tकेन्द्रिकृत हुनेछ ।"
"<br/>\n"
"\t\t\tCtrl+T, \"फोकस->ट्रयाक वस्तु\" मेनु वस्तु, वा \"ताल्चा\"\n"
"\t\t\tउपकरणपट्टी बटन प्रयोग गर्नुहोस् । तपाईँ पनि यसलाई साधारण रूपमा डबल क्लिक "
"गरेर वस्तु\n"
"\t\t\tकेन्द्रिकृत गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ वा वस्तुको पपअप मेनुबाट \"केन्द्र र ट्रयाक \" "
"चयन गरेर\n"
"\t\t\tगर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:33
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The KStars Handbook includes the AstroInfo Project, a series\n"
"\t\t\tof informative articles about Astronomy.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>केस्टार्स हातेपुस्तिकाले एस्ट्रोइन्फो परियोजना समावेश गर्दछ, खगोलशास्त्रको "
"बारेमा\n"
"\t\t\tसूचनात्मक लेखको श्रेणी ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:41
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>There are three on-screen \"Info Boxes\" which show data related to the\n"
"\t\t\ttime/date, your geographic location, and the current central position on "
"the\n"
"\t\t\tsky (the focus).  You can drag these boxes with the mouse, and \"shade\" "
"them\n"
"\t\t\tby double-clicking them to show more (or less) information.  You can "
"hide\n"
"\t\t\tthem altogether in the Settings->Info Boxes menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>त्यहाँ तीन पर्दा-भित्र \"सूचना बाकस\" छन् जसले समय/मिति, तपाईँको भौगोलिक "
"स्थान, र आकाश (फोकस) मा हालको केन्द्रिय स्थिति\n"
"\t\t\tसँग सम्बन्धित डेटा\n"
"\t\t\tदेखाउँदछ ।  तपाईँ यी बाकसहरू माउसद्वारा तान्न सक्नुहुन्छ, र धेरै (वा "
"थोरै) सूचना देखाउँन तिनीहरूलाई डबल क्लिक गरेर\n"
"\t\t\t\"छायाँ\" लगाउन सकिन्छ ।  तपाईँ तिनीहरूलाई एकै ठाउँ सेटिङ->"
"सूचना बाकस मेनुमा\n"
"\t\t\tलुकाउँनु सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:52
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>KStars has a full-screen mode; you can toggle this mode using the\n"
"\t\t\t\"fullscreen\" toolbar button, or by pressing Ctrl+Shift+F.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>के स्टार्ससँग पूरा-पर्दा मोड छ; तपाईँ यो मोडलाई \"पूरा पर्दा\" उपकरणपट्टी "
"बटन प्रयोग गरेर, वा Ctrl+Shift+F थिचेर\n"
"\t\t\t\"टगल गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:60
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The N,S,E,W keys will point the display at the North,\n"
"\t\t\tSouth, East and West points on the Horizon.  The Z key will point the\n"
"\t\t\tdisplay at the Zenith.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>N,S,E,W कुञ्जीले क्षितिजमा उत्तर, दक्षिण, पूर्व र पश्चिम बिन्दु\n"
"\t\t\tमा प्रदर्शन इङ्कित गर्नेछ ।  Z कुञ्जीले जेनिथमा प्रदर्शन\n"
"\t\t\tइङ्कित गर्नेछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:69
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The 0-9 keys will center the display on one of the major solar system\n"
"\t\t\tbodies.  0 centers on the Sun, 3 centers on the Moon; the rest are the "
"eight\n"
"\t\t\tplanets, in order of their distance from the Sun.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>०-९ कुञ्जीले एउटा मुख्य सौरमण्डल भागको प्रदर्शनमा\n"
"\t\t\tकेन्द्रित गर्नेछ ।  ० ले घामलाई केन्द्रित गर्दछ, ३ ले चन्द्रमामा "
"केन्द्रित गर्दछ, बाँकी घामबाट तिनीहरूको दूरी क्रममा\n"
"\t\t\tआठ ग्रहहरू हुन् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:78
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>Click and Drag with the mouse to slew the skymap to a new position on\n"
"\t\t\tthe sky.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>आकाशमा नयाँ स्थितिमा आकाशे नक्सा हटाउन माउसद्वारा\n"
"\t\t\tक्लिक गर्नुहोस् र तान्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:86
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>Double-click with the mouse to center the display on the location\n"
"\t\t\tof the mouse cursor.  If you double-click on an object, KStars will\n"
"\t\t\tautomatically begin tracking it.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>माउस कर्सरको स्थानमा प्रदर्शन केन्द्रित गर्न माउससँग \n"
"\t\t\tडबल क्लिक गर्नुहोस् ।  यदि तपाईँले एउटा वस्तुमा डबल क्लिक गर्नुभयो भने, "
"के स्टार्सले यसलाई\n"
"\t\t\tस्वचालित रूपमा ट्रयाकिङ गर्न सुरु गर्दछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:95
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The status bar displays the current sky coordinates of the mouse cursor,\n"
"\t\t\tin both Equatorial and Horizontal coordinate systems.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>वस्तुस्थितिपट्टीले दुवै भुमध्यवर्ती र तेर्सो समकक्ष प्रणालीमा माउस कर्सरको "
"हालको आकाशे समकक्ष,\n"
"\t\t\tप्रदर्शन गर्दछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:103
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The display can be zoomed in or out by spinning your mouse's scroll wheel,\n"
"\t\t\tor by dragging the mouse up or down with the middle mouse button pressed. "
" You\n"
"\t\t\tcan also use the +/- keys, or the \"Zoom In\"/\"Zoom Out\" items in the "
"toolbar and\n"
"\t\t\tin the View menu.  The Zoom Level can be set manually using the \"Zoom to "
"Angular\n"
"\t\t\tSize\" item in the View menu (Shift+Ctrl+Z), and you can set it "
"graphically by\n"
"\t\t\tholding down the Ctrl button while dragging the mouse to define a "
"rectangle for\n"
"\t\t\tthe new window boundaries.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँको माउसको स्क्रोल ह्वील घुमाएर वा थिचिएको बीचको माउस बटनसँग माथि तल "
"माउस तानेर,\n"
"\t\t\tप्रदर्शनको जुम बढाउन वा घटाउन सकिन्छ ।  तपाईँ\n"
"\t\t\tउपकरणपट्टी र दृश्य मेनुमा +/- कुञ्जी, वा \"जुम बढाउनुहोस्\"/\"जुम "
"घटाउनुहोस्\" वस्तु\n"
"\t\t\tपनि प्रयोग गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।  जुम स्तर दृश्य मेनु (Shift+Ctrl+Z)मा "
"\"कोणिक साइजमा जुम गर्ने\" वस्तु प्रयोग गरेर म्यानुल्ली\n"
"\t\t\tसेट गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ, र तपाईँ यसलाई नयाँ सञ्झ्याल सीमाका लागि आयात "
"परिभाषित गर्न\n"
"\t\t\tमाउस तान्दा Ctrl बटन समातेर\n"
"\t\t\tग्राफिकल्ली सेट गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:116
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>You can manually set the coordinates of the central Focus point.\n"
"\t\t\tPress Ctrl+M, or use the \"Focus->Set Focus Manually...\" menu item, and "
"enter\n"
"\t\t\tthe desired coordinates in the popup window.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँ म्यानुल्ली रूपमा केन्द्रिय फोकस बिन्दुको समकक्ष सेट गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t\tCtrl+M थिच्नुहोस्, वा \"फोकस->म्यानुल्ली फोकस सेट गर्नुहोस्...\" मेनु "
"वस्तु प्रयोग गर्नुहोस्, र पपअप सञ्झ्यालमा इच्छयाएको समकक्ष\n"
"\t\t\tप्रविष्ट गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:125
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>To switch between Equatorial and Horizontal coordinate\n"
"\t\t\tsystems, use the \"View->Coordinates\" menu item, or press the spacebar.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>भूमध्यवर्ती र तेर्सो समकक्ष प्रणाली बीच स्विच\n"
"\t\t\tगर्न, \"दृश्य->समकक्ष\" मेनु वस्तु प्रयोग गर्नुहोस्, वा खाली स्थानपट्टी "
"थिच्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:133
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>To set the Time and Date, type Ctrl+S, use the \"Time->"
"Set Time\" menu item,\n"
"\t\t\tor press the \"time\" toolbar button.  Note that dates in KStars can be "
"very\n"
"\t\t\tremote; you can use any year between -50,000 and +50,000.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>समय र मिति सेट गर्न, Ctrl+S टाइप गर्नुहोस्, \"समय->"
"समय सेट गर्नुहोस्\" प्रयोग गर्नुहोस्,\n"
"\t\t\tवा \"समय\" उपकरणपट्टी बटन थिच्नुहोस् ।  याद गर्नुहोस् कि के स्टार्स धेरै "
"टाढा\n"
"\t\t\tहुन सक्छ; तपाईँ -५०,००० र +५०,००० बीच कुनै वर्ष प्रयोग गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:142
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>You can use Ctrl+E or the \"Time->Set Time to Now\" menu item to "
"synchronize\n"
"\t\t\tthe simulation clock with your CPU clock.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँ आफ्नो सीपीयू घडीसँग नक्कली घडी समक्रमन गर्न\n"
"\t\t\tCtrl+E वा \"समय->अहिले समय सेट गर्नुहोस्\" मेनु वस्तु प्रयोग गर्न "
"सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:150
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The Spin Box in the Toolbar allows you to adjust the time step\n"
"\t\t\tused by the KStars clock; setting it to \"1.0 sec\" provides \"real "
"time\".\n"
"\t\t\tNote: negative values make time run backwards.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>उपकरणपट्टीमा स्पिन बाकसले के स्टार्स घडीले प्रयोग गरेको समय रण समायोजन गर्न\n"
"\t\t\tअनुमति दिन्छ; यसलाई \"१.० सेकेन्ड\" मा सेटिङ गर्नाले \"वास्तविक समय\" "
"उपलब्ध हुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t\tद्रष्टब्य: ऋणात्मक मानले समयलाई पछितिर धकेल्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:159
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>You can stop and start the clock with the \"Play/Pause\" button\n"
"\t\t\tin the Toolbar, or with the \"Time->Stop/Start Clock\" menu item.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँ उपकरणपट्टीमा \"प्ले/पज\"\n"
"\t\t\tबटनद्वारा, वा \"समय->घडी रोक्नुहोस्/सुरु गर्नुहोस्\" मेनु वस्तुसँग घडी "
"रोक्न र सुरु गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:167
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>You can advance the simulation clock forward or backward by a single\n"
"\t\t\ttime step by pressing the \"&gt;\" or \"&lt;\" keys.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँ \"&gt;\" वा \"&lt;\" कुञ्जी थिचेर एकल समय चरणद्वारा अगाडि र पछाडि\n"
"\t\t\tनक्कली घडी उन्नत गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:175
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>When you click your mouse in the map, the object in the sky nearest\n"
"\t\t\tthe mouse cursor is identified in the status bar.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँले नक्सामा माउस क्लिक गर्दा, माउस कर्सर नजिकको आकाशे वस्तु\n"
"\t\t\tवस्तुस्थितिपट्टीमा परिभाषित हुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:183
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>When you hold the mouse cursor still for a moment, the nearest object\n"
"\t\t\twill be identified by a temporary name label that automatically fades\n"
"\t\t\tout when you move the mouse again.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँले त्यो क्षणसम्मका लागि माउस कर्सर समात्दा, सबभन्दा नजिकको वस्तु\n"
"\t\t\tअस्थायी नाम लेबुलद्वारा परिभाषित हुनेछ जुन तपाईँले फेरि माउस सार्दा\n"
"\t\t\tस्वचालित रूपमा हराउँछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:192
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>Right-click with the mouse to open a popup menu of detailed options\n"
"\t\t\tfor a particular object, including links to images and information on\n"
"\t\t\tthe Internet.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>इन्टरनेटमा सूचना र छविमा लिङ्क समावेश गरेर, निश्चित वस्तुका लागि\n"
"\t\t\tविस्तृत गरिएको विकल्पको पपअप मेनु खोल्न\n"
"\t\t\tमाउससँग दायाँ-क्लिक गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:201
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The deep-sky objects with a special color (the default is Red)\n"
"\t\t\thave extra URL links available in their popup menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>विशेष रङ (पूर्वानिर्धारित रातो) भएको गाढा-आकाशे वस्तुसँग\n"
"\t\t\tतिनीहरूको पपअप मेनुमा अतिरिक्त यूआरएल लिङ्क उपलब्ध छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:209
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>By default, stars in KStars are displayed with realistic colors.\n"
"\t\t\tA star's color depends on its temperature; cooler stars are red,\n"
"\t\t\twhile hotter stars are blue.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>पूर्वानिर्धारण अनुसार, के स्टार्समा ताराहरू वास्तविक रङमा प्रदर्शन हुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t\tएउटा ताराको रङ यसको तापक्रममा भ् पर्दछreचिसो ताराहरू रातो हुन्छन्ed,\n"
"\t\tभने तातो ताराहरू नीला हुन्छन् ।e.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:218
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>If you want the very latest orbital information for asteroids and\n"
"\t\t\tcomets (including recently-discovered objects), check the \"Download\n"
"\t\t\tData\" tool (\"File|Download Data\" or Ctrl+D) frequently for updated\n"
"\t\t\tephemerides.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>यदि तपाईँ (हालै पत्ता लगाइएको वस्तु समावेश गरेर) ग्रहिका र पुच्छ्रेताराका "
"लागि\n"
"\t\t\tधेरै पछिल्लो अक्षिय सूचना चाहनुहुन्छ भने, अद्यावधिक भएको इफेमेरिड्सका "
"लागि\n"
"\t\t\t\"डेटा डाउनलोड\" उपकरण (\"File|Download Data\" वा Ctrl+D) बारम्बार\n"
"\t\t\t जाँच गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:228
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The Details window provides a large amount of information on any \n"
"\t\t\tobject in the sky, including coordinates, rise/set times, internet \n"
"\t\t\tlinks, and your own custom notes.  Access the Details window through \n"
"\t\t\tthe popup menu, or by clicking on an object and then pressing \"D\".\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>विस्तृत सञ्झ्यालले ठूलो सङ्ख्यामा सूचना आकाशमा कुनै वस्तुको बारेमा सूचना\n"
"\t\t\tउपलब्ध गराउँदछ, जसमा समकक्ष, उदाउने/अस्ताउने समय, इन्टरनेट \n"
"\t\t\tलिङ्क, र तपाईँको आफ्नो अनुकूल द्रष्टब्य समावेश हुन्छ ।  पपअप मेनु\n"
"\t\t\tमार्फत, वा एउटा वस्तुलाई क्लिक गरेर र \"D\" लाई थिचेर विस्तृत सञ्झ्याल "
"पहुँच गर्न सकिन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:238
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>You can attach a name label to any object in the sky.  Toggle the \n"
"\t\t\tlabel in the popup menu, or by clicking on the object and then \n"
"\t\t\tpressing \"L\".\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँ आकाशमा कुनै वस्तुमा नाम लेबुल संलग्न गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।  पपअप \n"
"\t\t\tमेनुमा, वा वस्तुमा क्लिक गरेर र\n"
"\t\t\t \"L\" थिचेर लेबुल टगल गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:247
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The KStars Astrocalculator (Ctrl+C) gives you direct access to many \n"
"\t\t\tof the calculations that KStars does behind-the-scenes.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>के स्टार्सको एस्ट्रो गणकयन्त्र (Ctrl+C) ले धेरैजसो गणनामा\n"
"\t\t\tसीधै पहुँच दिन्छ जहाँ के स्टार्स दृश्य पछाडि हुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:255
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The AAVSO Light Curve Generator tool (Ctrl+V) connects to a server at the\n"
"\t\t\tAmerican Association of Variable Star Observers, and constructs a\n"
"\t\t\tlightcurve for any of the 6000+ variable stars that they monitor\n"
"\t\t\ton a daily basis.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>AAVSO प्रकाश बक्र सर्जक उपकरण (Ctrl+V) ले चल तारा अन्वेषकको अमेरिकी संघमा "
"सर्भरमा\n"
"\t\t\tजडान गर्दछ, र कुनै पनि ६०००+ चल ताराका लागि\n"
"\t\t\tप्रकाश बक्र निर्माण गर्दछ जुन तिनीहरू\n"
"\t\t\tदैनिक आधारमा अनुगमन गर्दछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:265
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The Altitude vs. Time tool (Ctrl+A) will plot altitude curves for any group\n"
"\t\t\tof objects that you select.  This is a great tool for planning\n"
"\t\t\tobserving sessions.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>उन्नतांश विपरीत समय उपकरण (Ctrl+A) ले तपाईँले चयन गर्नुभएकोवस्तुको कुनै "
"समूहका लागि\n"
"\t\t\tउन्नतांश बक्र बनाउनेछ ।  यो अन्वेषण सत्र योजनाका लागि\n"
"\t\t\tमहान उपकरण हो ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:274
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>With the What's Up Tonight? tool (Ctrl+U), you can tell at a glance what\n"
"\t\t\tobjects will be visible from your location on a given night.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>आज राती के छ? उपरकरणसँग, तपाईँ हेराइमा\n"
"\t\t\tदिएको रातमा तपाईँको स्थानबाट के वस्तु दृश्यात्मक हुनेछ भन्ने कुरा भन्न "
"सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:282
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The Observing List tool (Ctrl+L) gives you easy access to a selected group \n"
"\t\t\tof objects.  Add objects to the list through the popup menu, or by\n"
"\t\t\tclicking on the object, and pressing \"O\".\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>अवलोकन सूची उपकरण (Ctrl+L) ले वस्तुको चयन गरेको समूहमा सजिलै\n"
"\t\t\tपहुँच गर्न दिन्छ ।  पपअप मेनु\n"
"मार्फत, वा वस्तुमा\n"
"\t\t\tक्लिक गरेर, \"O\" थिचेर सूचिबद्ध गर्न वस्तु थप्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:291
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The ScriptBuilder tool allows you to construct complex DCOP\n"
"\t\t\tscripts using a simple GUI.  The scripts can be played back later\n"
"\t\t\tfrom the command line, or from within KStars.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>स्क्रिप्ट निर्माणकर्ता उपकरणले तपाईँलाई साधरण जीयूआई प्रयोग गरेर जटिल "
"डीसीओपी स्क्रिप्ट निर्माण गर्न\n"
"\t\t\tअनुमति दिन्छ ।  स्क्रिप्ट पछि आदेश रेखाबाट, वा के स्टार्स भित्रबाट\n"
"\t\t\tखेलाउन सकिन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:300
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The Solar System Viewer tool (Ctrl+Y) shows an overhead view of the solar\n"
"\t\t\tsystem, showing the positions of the major planets for the current\n"
"\t\t\tsimulation date.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>सौरमण्डल दर्शक उपकरण (Ctrl+Y) ले हालको नक्कली मितिका लागि मुख्य ग्रहको "
"स्थिति देखाएर, सौरमण्डलको\n"
"\t\t\t एउटा, \n"
"\t\t\tसंलग्न दृश्य देखाउँछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:309
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The Jupiter Moons tool (Ctrl+J) shows the relative positions of Jupiter's\n"
"\t\t\tfour largest moons (Io, Europa, Ganymede and Callisto), as seen from\n"
"\t\t\tEarth, and as a function of time.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>बृहस्पतिको चन्द्रमा उपकरण (Ctrl+J) ले पृथ्वीबाट देखिएको रूपमा, र\n"
"\t\t\t समयको प्रकार्यको रूपमा बृहस्पतिको चौथो ठूलो, चन्द्रमा (लो, युरोपा, "
"ग्यानीमेड र कलिस्टो) को\n"
"\t\t\tसापेक्षिक स्थिति देखाउँछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:318
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>You can export the sky image to a file using the \"Save Sky Image\"\n"
"\t\t\titem in the File menu, or by pressing Ctrl+I.  In addition, you can\n"
"\t\t\trun KStars from a command prompt with the \"--dump\" argument to save a\n"
"\t\t\tsky image to disk without even opening the program window.  This can\n"
"\t\t\tbe used to generate dynamic wallpaper for your KDE desktop.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँ आकाशे छवि फाइल मेनुमा \"आकाशे छवि बचत गर्नुहोस्\" वस्तु प्रयोग गरेर, "
"वा Ctrl+l थिचेर\n"
"\t\t\tफाइलमा निर्गात गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।  थपमा, तपाईँ कुनै\n"
"\t\t\tकार्यक्रम सञ्झ्याल खोली डिस्कमा आकाशे छवि बचत गर्न \"--dump\" तर्कसँग "
"आदेश प्रबर्द्धनबाट a\n"
"\t\t\tके स्टार्स चलाउन सक्नुहुन्छ ।  यो तपाईँको\n"
"\t\t\tकेडीई डेस्कटपका लागि गतिशील वालपेपर सिर्जना गर्न प्रयोग गर्न सकिन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:329
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>To add your own custom Object Catalogs, select\n"
"\t\t\t\"Add Catalog\" from the Catalogs tab in the KStars Configuration "
"window.\n"
"\t\t\tSee the Handbook for instructions on formatting your catalog file.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँको आफ्नो अनुकूल वस्तु विवरणिका थप्न, के स्टार्स कन्फिगरेसन सञ्झ्यालमा\n"
"\t\t\t विवरणिकाबाट \"विवरणिका थप्नुहोस्\" चयन गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t\tतपाईँको विवरणिका फाइल ढाँचामा प्रशिक्षणका लागि हातेपुस्तिका हेर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:338
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>To add your own custom image/information URLs to\n"
"\t\t\tany object, select \"Add Link...\" from the object's popup menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>कुनै वस्तुमा तपाईँको आफ्नो अनुकूल छवि/सूचना यू आर एल\n"
"\t\t\tथप्न, वस्तुको पपअप मेनुबाट \"लिङ्क थप्नुहोस्...\" चयन गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:346
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>You can adjust dozens of display options by clicking the\n"
"\t\t\t\"configure\" Toolbar button, or selecting the \"Settings->"
"Configure KStars...\"\n"
"\t\t\tmenu item.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँ \"कन्फिगर\" बटन क्लिक गरेर, वा \"सेटिङ->कन्फिगर के स्टार्स...\" मेनु "
"वस्तु\n"
"\t\t\tचयन गरेर प्रदर्शन विकल्पको दर्जन\n"
"\t\t\tसमायोजन गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:355
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The on-screen Info Boxes can be hidden or shown using the\n"
"\t\t\t\"Settings->Info Boxes\" menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>पर्दा भित्रका सूचना बाकसहरू \"सेटिङ->सूचना बाकस\" प्रयोग गरेर लुकाउन वा "
"देखाउन\n"
"\t\t\t सकिन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:363
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The Toolbars can be hidden or shown using the \"Settings->Toolbars\" menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>उपकरणपट्टी \"सेटिङ->उपकरणपट्टी\" मेनु प्रयोग गरेर लुकाउन वा देखाउन\n"
"\t\t सकिन्छ ।</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:370
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>You can hide either the Ra/Dec or Az/Alt coordinate fields in the "
"statusbar,\n"
"\t\t\tor hide the stausbar completely, using the Settings|Statusbar menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँ वस्तुस्थितिपट्टीमा या त Ra/Dec वा Az/Alt समकक्ष फिल्ड लुकाउन "
"सक्नुहुन्छ,\n"
"\t\t\tवा सेटिङ|वस्तुस्थिति मेनु प्रयोग गरेर, पूर्ण रूपमा वस्तुस्थितिपट्टी "
"लुकाउन सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:378
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>You can easily switch between predefined color schemes by selecting\n"
"\t\t\tthe scheme from the \"Settings->Color Schemes\" menu.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँ \"सेटिङ->रङ योजना\" मेनुबाट योजना चयन गरेर पूर्वपरिभाषित रङ बीच सजिलै "
"स्वीच\n"
"\t\t\tगर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:386
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>You can define your own Geographic Locations.  Fill in the\n"
"\t\t\trequired fields in the \"Change Location\" Dialog and then press the\n"
"\t\t\t\"Add to List\" button. Your Locations will be available in all\n"
"\t\t\tfuture sessions.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँ आफ्नो भौगोलिक स्थान परिभाषा गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।  \"स्थान परिवर्तन "
"गर्नुहोस्\" संवादमा\n"
"\t\t\tआवश्यक फिल्ड भर्नुहोस् र त्यसपछि \"सूचीमा थप्नुहोस्\" बटन\n"
"\t\t\tथिच्नुहोस् । तपाईँको स्थान सबै भावी सत्रमा उपलब्ध\n"
"\t\t\tहुनेछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:396
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>You can define your own Color Schemes.  Adjust the colors\n"
"\t\t\tin the Configuration Window's \"Colors\" Tab, and then press the \"Save\n"
"\t\t\tCurrent Colors\" button. Your Color Scheme will appear in the list in\n"
"\t\t\tall future sessions.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँ आफ्नो रङ योजना परिभाषित गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।  कन्फिगरेसन सञ्झ्यालको "
"\"रङ\" ट्याबमा रङ\n"
"\t\t\tसमायोजन गर्नुहोस्, र त्यसपछि \"हालको रङ बचत गर्नुहोस्\" बटन\n"
"\t\t\t थिच्नुहोस् । तपाईँको रङ योजना सबै भावी सत्रमा सूचीभित्र\n"
"\t\t\tदेखापर्नेछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:406
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>You can construct your own field-of-view (FOV) symbols, using the\n"
"\t\t\tFOV Editor under the Tools menu.  You can set the angular size, the\n"
"\t\t\tshape, and the color of your new symbols.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>तपाईँ उपकरण मेनु अन्तर्गत एफओभी सम्पादक प्रयोग गरेर, तपाईँको आफ्नो फिल्ड "
"दृश्य (एफओभी) प्रतीक\n"
"\t\t\tनिर्माण गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।  तपाईँ आफ्नो नयाँ प्रतीकको कोणिक साइज, आकार, र "
"रङ\n"
"\t\t\tसेट गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:415
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The Advanced tab of the KStars Configuration window allows you to fine-tune\n"
"\t\t\tthe behavior of KStars. You can specify whether to correct for "
"atmospheric\n"
"\t\t\trefraction, and whether to use animated slewing. You can also specify "
"which\n"
"\t\t\tobjects are hidden while the display is in motion.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>के स्टार्स कन्फिगरेसन सञ्झ्यालको उन्नत ट्याबले के स्टार्सको व्यवहार राम्रो "
"बनाउँन\n"
"\t\t\tअनुमति दिन्छ । तपाईँ वायुमण्डलिय अपर्वतनका लागि \n"
"\t\t\tसुधार गर्ने वा नगर्ने, र एनिमेट गरिएको स्ल्विङ प्रयोग गर्ने वा नगर्ने "
"निर्दिष्ट गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ । तपाईँले प्रदर्शन चालमा हुँदा कुन वस्तु लुकाइएको छ\n"
"\t\t\tभन्ने कुरा पनि निर्दिष्ट गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:425
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>KStars displays 126,000 stars, 13,000 deep-sky objects, 88 constellations,\n"
"\t\t\tall planets, the Sun, the Moon, thousands of comets and asteroids, and "
"the\n"
"\t\t\tMilky Way.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>के स्टार्सले १२६,००० ताराहरू, १३,००० गहिरो-आकाशे वस्तु, ८८ तारामण्डल,\n"
"\t\t\tसबै ग्रह, घाम, चन्द्रमा, हजारौ पुच्छ्रेतारा र ग्रहिका र\n"
"\t\t\tमिल्की वे प्रदर्शन गर्दछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:434
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The line in the sky that the Sun and all the Planets seem to follow\n"
"\t\t\tis called the Ecliptic.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>आकाशमा देखिने रेखा जसलाई घाम र सबै ग्रहहरूले पछ्याइरहेको हुन्छ, त्यसलाई\n"
"\t\t\t क्रांतिमण्डल भनिन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:442
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>Object positions in KStars include the effects of precession, nutation,\n"
"\t\t\taberration, atmospheric refraction, and light travel time (for planets).\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>के स्टार्समा वस्तु स्थितिले (ग्रहका लागि) प्रिसेसन, न्यूटेसन, एबरेसन, "
"वायुमण्डलीय अपवर्तन, प्रकाश हिड्ने समयको प्रभाव\n"
"\t\t\tसमावेश गर्दछ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:450
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The nearest star to the Sun is Rigel Kentaurus (alpha Centauri).\n"
"\t\t\tThe brightest star in the sky is Sirius (alpha Canis Majoris).\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>घाम देखि सबभन्दा नजिकको तारा रिजेल केन्टाउसर (अल्फा सेन्टाउरी) हो ।\n"
"\t\t\tआकाशमा सबभन्दा चम्किलो तारा सिरिअस (अल्फा क्यानिस मेजोरिस) हो ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:458
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The large group of galaxies between Leo, Virgo and Coma Berenices\n"
"\t\t\tis called the Virgo Cluster of Galaxies.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>लियो, भिर्गो र कोमा बेरिनेसिस बीच ग्यालेक्सीको ठूलो समूहलाई\n"
"\t\t\tग्यालेक्सीको भिर्गो क्लस्टार भनिन्छ ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:466
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The large group of clusters and nebulae near the south celestial pole\n"
"\t\t\tare objects in the Large Magellanic Cloud, which is a dwarf galaxy in\n"
"\t\t\torbit around the Milky Way.\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>दक्षिणी खगोलिय ध्रुव नजिकको क्लस्टर र नेबुलेको ठूलो समूह\n"
"\t\t\tठूलो म्यागेलानिक क्लाउडमा वस्तुहरू हुन्, जुन मिल्की वे वरिपरि अकक्षमा "
"सबभन्दा होचो\n"
"\t\t\tग्यालेक्सी हो ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

#: tips.cpp:475
msgid ""
"\t\t"
"<p>The Messier Catalog is a list of 110 of the brightest non-stellar objects\n"
"\t\t\tin the sky.  It includes such famous objects as the Orion Nebula (M 42), "
"the\n"
"\t\t\tAndromeda Galaxy (M 31), and the Pleiades (M 45).\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"
msgstr ""
"\t\t"
"<p>अस्तव्यस्त विवरणिका आकाशमा ११० चम्किला तारामय नभएको वस्तुको\n"
"\t\t\tसूची हो ।  यसले अन्य प्रसिद्ध वस्तु पनि समावेश गर्दछ जस्तै ओरियन नेबुला "
"(M 42),\n"
"\t\t\tएन्ड्रोमेडा ग्यालेक्सी (M 31), र प्लियडेस (M 45) ।\n"
"\t\t</p>\n"
"\t\n"

